    "rendered": "Power Jet AC Service in Vadodara: The Ultimate Solution for AC Cooling Problems"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<div class=\"atlas-purified-matrix\"><script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: { sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'] },\n                    colors: { atlasDark: '#0f172a', atlasBlue: '#0ea5e9', atlasAlert: '#ef4444' }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@graph\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"HVACBusiness\",\n          \"name\": \"Atlas Aircon Engineering\",\n          \"image\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/comman-problems-of-AC-scaled.jpg\",\n          \"@id\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/#organization\",\n          \"url\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/\",\n          \"telephone\": \"+91-9727257141\",\n          \"priceRange\": \"₹₹\",\n          \"address\": {\n            \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n            \"streetAddress\": \"Serving All GIDC and Residential Zones\",\n            \"addressLocality\": \"Vadodara\",\n            \"addressRegion\": \"GJ\",\n            \"postalCode\": \"390001\",\n            \"addressCountry\": \"IN\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"TechArticle\",\n          \"headline\": \"The Science of Power Jet AC Servicing: Hydro-Extraction in Vadodara\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Person\",\n            \"name\": \"Mehfuz Shahid Khan\",\n            \"jobTitle\": \"Lead HVAC Architect\"\n          },\n          \"publisher\": {\"@id\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/#organization\"}\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Service\",\n          \"serviceType\": \"Power Jet AC Service\",\n          \"provider\": {\"@id\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/#organization\"},\n          \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"City\", \"name\": \"Vadodara\"},\n          \"name\": \"Industrial-Grade Power Jet AC Service\",\n          \"description\": \"High-pressure hydro-extraction of biofilm, dust, and microbial buildup from AC evaporator coils.\",\n          \"offers\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n            \"price\": \"499\",\n            \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n    </script>\n\n\n    <div class=\"bg-atlasAlert text-white text-center py-2 text-sm font-bold tracking-wide uppercase\">\n        ⚡ Technicians currently active in Vadodara. Average response time: 45 Minutes.\n    </div>\n\n    <nav class=\"bg-white border-b border-slate-200 sticky top-0 z-40 shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 py-4 flex justify-between items-center\">\n            <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com\" class=\"text-2xl font-black text-atlasDark tracking-tighter\">\n                ATLAS<span class=\"text-atlasBlue\">AIRCON</span>\n            </a>\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex space-x-6 font-semibold text-sm\">\n                <a href=\"#engineering\" class=\"text-slate-600 hover:text-atlasBlue transition\">The Science</a>\n                <a href=\"#pricing\" class=\"text-slate-600 hover:text-atlasBlue transition\">Tariffs</a>\n                <a href=\"#faq\" class=\"text-slate-600 hover:text-atlasBlue transition\">FAQ</a>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"bg-atlasDark text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-lg font-bold text-sm hover:bg-atlasBlue transition\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt mr-2\"></i> 97272 57141\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <main>\n        <section class=\"relative bg-slate-900 overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/comman-problems-of-AC-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"AC Service Background\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" title=\"\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-20 lg:py-32 relative z-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n                <div>\n                    <span class=\"bg-atlasBlue/20 text-sky-400 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs uppercase tracking-widest border border-sky-500/30\">Verified Local Service</span>\n                    <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mt-6 mb-6\">\n                        Stop Breathing <span class=\"text-atlasBlue\">Recycled Dust.</span>\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"text-lg text-slate-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed\">\n                        A standard foam wash just pushes dirt deeper into the fins. Our <strong>Power Jet Hydro-Extraction</strong> physically blasts away rigid biofilm, fungal growth, and micro-debris to restore factory-level cooling.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4\">\n                        <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141?text=I+need+to+book+a+Power+Jet+AC+Service+in+Vadodara\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-400 text-slate-900 font-black py-4 px-8 rounded-xl text-center transition flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-green-500/30\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            <i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp text-2xl mr-2\"></i> Book Tech Visit\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"#pricing\" class=\"bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-xl text-center transition border border-slate-600\">\n                            View Rate Card\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hidden md:block\">\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-2xl\">\n                            <div class=\"text-3xl text-atlasBlue mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-snowflake\"></i></div>\n                            <div class=\"text-2xl font-black text-white mb-1\">99%</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm font-semibold\">Airflow Restored</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-2xl\">\n                            <div class=\"text-3xl text-amber-400 mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-bolt\"></i></div>\n                            <div class=\"text-2xl font-black text-white mb-1\">-25%</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm font-semibold\">Power Consumption</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-2xl\">\n                            <div class=\"text-3xl text-green-400 mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-shield-virus\"></i></div>\n                            <div class=\"text-2xl font-black text-white mb-1\">Total</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm font-semibold\">Allergen Removal</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-2xl\">\n                            <div class=\"text-3xl text-purple-400 mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-award\"></i></div>\n                            <div class=\"text-2xl font-black text-white mb-1\">3 Month</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm font-semibold\">Service Guarantee</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"engineering\" class=\"py-20 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-atlasDark\">The Anatomy of an AC Failure</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-500 font-medium mt-4\">Why your AC is taking longer to cool the room, and how we fix it.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-16\">\n                    <div>\n                        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/AC-Chemical-Wash-Deep-Cleaning-in-Vadodara.webp\" alt=\"AC Technician performing deep chemical cleaning\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-slate-100\" title=\"\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-atlasDark mb-4 border-l-4 border-atlasBlue pl-4\">The &#8220;Biofilm&#8221; Threat</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed\">\n                            When warm room air hits the freezing evaporator coil, condensation occurs. This constant moisture traps microscopic dust, creating a sticky, insulating layer known as <strong>Biofilm</strong>.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed\">\n                            Because this biofilm acts as an insulator, the refrigerant inside the copper pipes cannot absorb the heat from your room. The compressor has to work twice as hard, doubling your electricity bill and eventually leading to thermal overload (compressor failure).\n                        </p>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center text-slate-700 font-semibold\"><i class=\"fas fa-times-circle text-atlasAlert mr-3\"></i> Weak Airflow from Blower</li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center text-slate-700 font-semibold\"><i class=\"fas fa-times-circle text-atlasAlert mr-3\"></i> Water Leakage Inside the Room</li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center text-slate-700 font-semibold\"><i class=\"fas fa-times-circle text-atlasAlert mr-3\"></i> Musty, Sour Odor (Mold Spores)</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"bg-slate-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-black text-atlasDark mb-4\">The Atlas Hydro-Extraction Protocol</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-600 mb-6\">Our <strong>Power Jet AC Service in Vadodara</strong> is not a superficial wipe-down. We utilize a targeted, high-PSI water pump to force specialized eco-friendly degreasers entirely through the aluminum fin matrix. This flushes out the sludge blockages in the drain pan and completely sterilizes the blower wheel.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-20 bg-slate-900 text-white\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black\">Official Service Tariffs</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-400 mt-2\">Transparent, flat-rate pricing. No hidden diagnostic fees if service is performed.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl\">\n                    <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                        <thead>\n                            <tr class=\"bg-slate-950 text-slate-300 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider\">\n                                <th class=\"p-5 font-bold\">Intervention Type</th>\n                                <th class=\"p-5 font-bold border-l border-slate-800\">Window AC</th>\n                                <th class=\"p-5 font-bold border-l border-slate-800\">Split AC</th>\n                            </tr>\n                        </thead>\n                        <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-700\">\n                            <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-700/50 transition\">\n                                <td class=\"p-5\">\n                                    <div class=\"font-bold text-lg text-white\">Power Jet Hydro-Service</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1\">High-pressure water extraction &#038; filter sanitization.</div>\n                                </td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-black text-xl border-l border-slate-700\">₹ 499</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-black text-xl text-atlasBlue border-l border-slate-700\">₹ 599</td>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-700/50 transition\">\n                                <td class=\"p-5\">\n                                    <div class=\"font-bold text-lg text-white\">Advanced Chemical Wash</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1\">Coil degreasing to restore heat exchange efficiency.</div>\n                                </td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-bold text-lg border-l border-slate-700\">₹ 899</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-bold text-lg border-l border-slate-700\">₹ 999</td>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-700/50 transition\">\n                                <td class=\"p-5\">\n                                    <div class=\"font-bold text-lg text-white\">Refrigerant Gas Recharge</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1\">Vacuuming, leak testing, and weight-based charging.</div>\n                                </td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-bold text-lg border-l border-slate-700 text-amber-400\" colspan=\"2\">From ₹ 2500</td>\n                            </tr>\n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"py-16 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 shadow-sm border border-slate-200\">\n                    <div class=\"w-24 h-24 bg-atlasDark text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-4xl shrink-0 border-4 border-atlasBlue\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-user-tie\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <span class=\"bg-atlasBlue text-white text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-2 inline-block\">Chief Architect</span>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-atlasDark\">Mehfuz Shahid Khan</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-slate-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sm\">\n                            Director of Atlas Aircon. With over two decades of hands-on experience engineering, repairing, and optimizing HVAC systems across Gujarat&#8217;s industrial and residential sectors. Certified diagnostic authority for heavy cooling mechanics.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-20 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 max-w-3xl\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-atlasDark\">Client Intelligence (FAQ)</h2>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <details class=\"group bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl cursor-pointer\">\n                        <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-bold p-5 list-none text-slate-800\">\n                            <span>Foam Wash vs. Chemical Wash: Which is mathematically better?</span>\n                            <span class=\"transition group-open:rotate-180 text-atlasBlue\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                        </summary>\n                        <div class=\"p-5 pt-0 text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-200 mt-2\">\n                            A foam wash expands to lift surface dust and is great for regular maintenance. However, a <strong>Chemical Wash</strong> uses precise, eco-friendly solvents to break down the hardened oil, grease, and biological growth trapped deep inside the aluminum fins. For older units or heavy usage, chemical extraction is vastly superior.\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                    \n                    <details class=\"group bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl cursor-pointer\">\n                        <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-bold p-5 list-none text-slate-800\">\n                            <span>How does this service affect my power consumption?</span>\n                            <span class=\"transition group-open:rotate-180 text-atlasBlue\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                        </summary>\n                        <div class=\"p-5 pt-0 text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-200 mt-2\">\n                            When an AC coil is blocked by dust, the compressor must run significantly longer to achieve the desired room temperature. Our Jet Service restores the heat-exchange matrix, allowing the compressor to shut off sooner, directly lowering your electricity draw by up to 25%.\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141?text=Emergency+AC+Repair+Required\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"fixed bottom-6 right-6 bg-green-500 text-slate-900 w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-3xl shadow-2xl hover:scale-110 transition z-50 animate-bounce\" rel=\"noopener\">\n            <i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp\"></i>\n        </a>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class=\"bg-atlasDark text-slate-400 py-8 text-center text-sm\">\n        <p>&copy; 2026 HIAIRCON ENGINEERS PRIVATE LIMITED (Atlas Aircon). Verified Engineering Data.</p>\n    </footer>\n\n</div>",
